                    "text": "Kick-off meeting report"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The startoverleg for project {{projectNumber}} — {{projectName}} was held on {{startoverlegGehoudenOp}}, recorded in {{verslagStartoverlegReferentie}}."
